      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Dan Mangan is a Vancouver-based, two-time JUNO Award winning musician and two-time Polaris Music Prize listed musician. Mangan has toured extensively in North America, Europe and Australia and has released four studio LPs as well as a handful of other EPs."
